    d="M44 78C24.1 78 8 63.9 8 46.5S24.1 15 44 15c3.6 0 7 .5 10.3 1.4C61.4 6.4 73.6 0 87.4 0c19.6 0 36 12.9 40.2 30.1 2.6-.7 5.3-1.1 8.2-1.1 16.7 0 30.2 12.6 30.2 28.1 0 .9 0 1.8-.1 2.6 9.6 2.2 16.7 10.2 16.7 19.6 0 .3 0 .5-.1.8H44z"
    fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg>
